  "details": "When launching the open beta VRChat, after the initial title screen fades out, there is a 30 second period where the screen is completely black, before the normal loading music starts and the login process begins. This delay also seems to happen after being timed out from worlds - eg, by putting the headset down in sleep mode until it times out, then putting it back on, you are again faced with a long time at a black screen.",
